WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.757
As transformers displace CNNs, do the old privacy
recipes still hold?

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:07.561
The authors note three things about ViT.

00:00:07.641 --> 00:00:12.398
First, without pooling its hidden representation is
barely distorted,

00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:16.533
so regularizing it works as well as regularizing
the input,

00:00:16.613 --> 00:00:18.917
yet high mutual information leaks.

00:00:18.997 --> 00:00:24.735
Second, global self-attention makes ViT robust to
large noise on part of the image,

00:00:24.815 --> 00:00:26.698
ideal for Cutout and CutMix.

00:00:26.778 --> 00:00:29.362
Third, every operation is patch-level.

00:00:29.442 --> 00:00:35.320
Together these point to a patch-level randomized
CutMix of the hidden representation.
